{"id":"wb-3-110","name":"青莲寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"青莲寺","text":"青莲寺，原名硖石寺，是位于中国山西省晋城市泽州县金村镇的佛寺，由上下两院建筑组成。青莲寺始建于北齐天保年间，唐、宋、明、清历代均有营建和修缮，保存有唐代彩塑、宋代木构及彩塑、历代碑刻、明代佛塔等遗存。1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9D%92%E8%8E%B2%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94811312,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94811312","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c55acdcc9e075607c30fd5db.jpg","title":"20260628_Lower_Qinglian_Temple_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260628_Lower_Qinglian_Temple_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/20260628_Lower_Qinglian_Temple_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​晋城泽州 青莲寺下寺","width":320,"height":213}}